          "queryType": "timeseries",
          "rawSql": "-- Score divided by the algorithm's own threshold, so every algorithm crosses 1 when it flags.\nSELECT timestamp AS time, algorithm, score / nullIf(threshold, 0) AS score\nFROM evaluations FINAL\nWHERE machine_id = ${machine_id:singlequote}\n  AND metric_name = ${metric_name:singlequote}\n  AND $__timeFilter(timestamp)\nORDER BY time",
